    <IRS990ScheduleO documentId="RetDoc1044400001">
      <SupplementalInformationDetail>
        <FormAndLineReferenceDesc>FORM 990, PART VI, SECTION A, LINE 6</FormAndLineReferenceDesc>
        <ExplanationTxt>THE ORGANIZATION HAS MEMBERS ON THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS AND SPONSORSHIP MEMBERS THAT ARE NOT ON THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS.</ExplanationTxt>
      </SupplementalInformationDetail>
      <SupplementalInformationDetail>
        <FormAndLineReferenceDesc>FORM 990, PART VI, SECTION A, LINE 7A</FormAndLineReferenceDesc>
        <ExplanationTxt>MEMBERS MEETING CERTAIN PARTICIPATION CRITERIA MAY OFFER AN INDIVIDUAL FOR ELECTION TO THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS. THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS HOWEVER IS SOLELY RESPONSIBLE FOR THE ELECTION OF ALL BOARD DIRECTORS.</ExplanationTxt>
      </SupplementalInformationDetail>
      <SupplementalInformationDetail>
        <FormAndLineReferenceDesc>FORM 990, PART VI, SECTION B, LINE 11B</FormAndLineReferenceDesc>
        <ExplanationTxt>THE ORGANIZATION UTILIZES A PUBLIC ACCOUNTING FIRM TO PREPARE ITS FORM 990. AFTER THE FIRM PREPARES THE FORM 990, THE CEO AND CONTROLLER OF EVONEXUS REVIEW THE FORM BEFORE IT IS FINALIZED AND SIGNED.</ExplanationTxt>
      </SupplementalInformationDetail>
      <SupplementalInformationDetail>
        <FormAndLineReferenceDesc>FORM 990, PART VI, SECTION B, LINE 12C</FormAndLineReferenceDesc>
        <ExplanationTxt>THE BOARD REVIEWS THE CONFLICT OF INTEREST POLICY YEARLY. IT IS ALSO SIGNED BY NEW MEMBERS.</ExplanationTxt>
      </SupplementalInformationDetail>
      <SupplementalInformationDetail>
        <FormAndLineReferenceDesc>FORM 990, PART VI, SECTION B, LINE 15</FormAndLineReferenceDesc>
        <ExplanationTxt>THE EXECUTIVE COMMITTEE OF THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS CONDUCTS AN ANNUAL COMPENSATION REVIEW FOR ALL COMPENSATED OFFICERS AND DIRECTORS THAT INCLUDES A REVIEW OF COMPARABILITY DATA AND CONTEMPORANEOUS SUBSTANTIATION OF THE DELIBERATION AND DECISION BEFORE APPROVING COMPENSATION PACKAGES FOR THESE INDIVIDUALS.</ExplanationTxt>
      </SupplementalInformationDetail>
      <SupplementalInformationDetail>
        <FormAndLineReferenceDesc>FORM 990, PART VI, SECTION C, LINE 18</FormAndLineReferenceDesc>
        <ExplanationTxt>THE ORGANIZATION WILL PROVIDE A COPY OF THE DOCUMENTS LISTED UPON REQUEST FROM THE PUBLIC.</ExplanationTxt>
      </SupplementalInformationDetail>
      <SupplementalInformationDetail>
        <FormAndLineReferenceDesc>FORM 990, PART VI, SECTION C, LINE 19</FormAndLineReferenceDesc>
        <ExplanationTxt>THE ORGANIZATION WILL MAKE ITS GOVERNING DOCUMENTS AND FINANCIAL STATEMENTS AVAILABLE TO THE PUBLIC UPON REQUEST.</ExplanationTxt>
      </SupplementalInformationDetail>
    </IRS990ScheduleO>
